// julia_grid gives one list per band of escape counts, fastest escapes
// first, and the set itself last. Each list holds Lines in grid units: a run
// of neighbouring cells in one row (Point(column, row) to Point(column after
// the run, row)) that escape in about the same number of steps.
//
