// times: each time over, the trail runs off one edge and comes back in at the
// other, a little lower, since the bob is a little slower. Then one swing
// fails to reach the top, the bob falls back, and from there it swings to and
// fro, each loop smaller than the last, spiralling in to rest at the centre.
